# USDA AMS Market News (MARS) API key — free, instant signup:
#   https://mymarketnews.ams.usda.gov/mymarketnews-api
#
# Only needed to refetch raw produce data (`bun run fetch`). Deriving region files from the
# committed caches in data/raw/ works offline without it, which is what CI does.
#
# Copy this file to .env (gitignored) and fill in the key; Bun loads it automatically.
MARS_API_KEY=

# The key that was in use before the one above. It is dead, but it was pasted into the
# conversation and so lives in the raw log forever; `bun run session` needs it to scrub the
# transcript, and refuses to run without it.
MARS_API_KEY_RETIRED=
